# Stray reference composite (likely CF-derived) — kept local, not part of the build
MonsterFarm/roster.png

# ── Cute Fantasy art (Kenmi) — licensed; redistribution forbidden, kept LOCAL only ──
# The license bars hosting the asset files anywhere downloadable, incl. a public repo
# (see doc/asset-credits.md). Import from https://kenmi-art.itch.io/cute-fantasy-rpg
# into Assets/Art/CuteFantasy/ to build from source.
# Entire CF art subfolders are kept local; only my own Art/ring.png stays tracked.
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/CuteFantasy/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/Buildings/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/Props/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/Tiles/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/BattleDecor/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/MonsterIcons/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/UIIcons/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/Menu/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/CityThumbs/
# How-to-Play manual illustrations are in-game SCREENSHOTS — they embed licensed CF art pixels,
# so keep them local too. The published build carries them; a source-only clone just shows blank
# manual pages, same as every other CF asset above.
MonsterFarm/Assets/Art/Manual/
# CF-derived sprites loaded at runtime + tilemap source images
MonsterFarm/Assets/Resources/MonsterAnim/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Resources/Monsters/
MonsterFarm/Assets/Tiles/CobbleSrc.png
MonsterFarm/Assets/Tiles/HedgeWall.png
MonsterFarm/Assets/Tiles/PavementSrc.png
MonsterFarm/Assets/Tiles/WaterSrc.png
